        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Held: Allows Alola Raichu to upgrade Thunderbolt into Stoked Sparksurfer.",
      "short_effect": "Held: Allows Alola Raichu to upgrade Thunderbolt into Stoked Sparksurfer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "Ｚパワーの　けっしょう。\nアローラちほうの　ライチュウの\n１０まんボルトを　Ｚワザに　かえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Z파워의 결정.\n알로라지방의 라이츄의\n10만볼트를 Z기술로 바꾼다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ｚ力量的結晶。\n會把阿羅拉地區雷丘的\n十萬伏特升級為Ｚ招式。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une cristallisation de la Force Z, permettant\nde transformer le Tonnerre d’un Raichu de\nla région d’Alola en capacité Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Kristall, dem Z-Kraft innewohnt.\nEr stuft Alola-Raichus Attacke Donnerblitz\nzu einer Z-Attacke auf.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal que confiere el Poder Z al movimiento Rayo\nde los Raichu de Alola.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristallo in cui è immagazzinato il Potere Z.\nConsente di trasformare la mossa Fulmine\ndel Raichu di Alola in una mossa Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a crystallized form of Z-Power. It upgrades\nAlolan Raichu’s Thunderbolt to a Z-Move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ｚパワーの　結晶。\nアローラ地方の　ライチュウの\n１０まんボルトを　Ｚワザに　変える。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
